{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"tanchat-consolidation-review-status","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanChat consolidation review status"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Local implementation is available in this checkout. Release remains held for human review. The full consolidation goal is not complete."}]},{"type":"table","align":[null,null,null],"header":[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Requirement"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Current evidence"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Remaining verification"}]}],"rows":[[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack-owned backend and identity"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shared PostgreSQL repositories, AuthService and SessionService; native authorization and revocation runtime tests"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Real account login and session behavior through the UI"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Complete harness at /chat"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"603 files under src/chat; complete current local test gate"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Feature-by-feature rendered parity and ordinary real tasks"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Replace the Builder harness"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Route redirects and retired private API boundaries; dedicated shared example and chart paths retained"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Real deep links, embeds and site navigation"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Preserve motion and touch"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Original handlers retained and wired; motion CSS emitted; gesture fixture checks"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Reported animation regression and actual touch-device behavior"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Preserve streams, copies, retries and context"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"245 PostgreSQL/runtime tests; original copy benchmarks retained"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Live reconnect, long-history tails and copy latency"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Shared site remains intact"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Site tests; chat stylesheet scoping; actual startup and cleanup appearance checks"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Real navigation into and out of chat"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Chat local execution bridge"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Original broker bridge and ownership contract retained; source restricts bridge to DEV at http://127.0.0.1:3002 and broker at port 4320"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Provide a verified compatible broker/runtime and wire the actual TanStack execution path; localhost:3001 and production currently cannot use this bridge"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Models, integrations, files, workflows and schedules"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Ported source and contract/runtime checks"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Real configured model, MCP account, workflow, schedule and saved-file tasks"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Cloudflare ownership"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Local bindings and worker configuration; draft secret work recorded in consolidation history"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Deploy approved revision, verify resources and usage attribution"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"chat.tanstack.com alias"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Safe canonical redirect handler and navigation tests"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"DNS activation and real HTTP redirect verification"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Electron"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Original native host, device/folder/update code and release scripts retained; 20 local tests"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Native account flow, notarized distributable and hosted updates if shipping"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Reproducible installation"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Current machine build passes"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Replace sibling-owned temporary browser-sandbox package references before clean CI installation"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Operational scripts"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Every original script listed in tanchat-script-port-inventory.json"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Resolve missing live diagnostics, smoke tests and research script dispositions"}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Release"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"No release performed"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Human review approval, deployment, deployed revision verification and cutover"}]}]]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The current combined local gate is /private/tmp/tanchat-consolidation-current-full-gate.log: five TypeScript checks pass, lint reports 106 warnings and zero errors, 508 site tests pass with two skipped, 2,208 harness tests pass in 224 files, and 20 Electron tests pass. The last separate PostgreSQL runtime result is /private/tmp/tanchat-runtime-all-original-files.log: 245 tests in 28 files."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Browser inspection of the local application was rejected by the browser tool's access policy. No alternate access path was used. Static source and fixture results do not close that verification gap."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See tanchat-consolidation.md for implementation history and evidence limits. Existing unrelated sibling work is preserved. No old account data is being migrated, and the old deployment is retained until replacement verification and approved cutover."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"tanchat-consolidation-review-status","text":"TanChat consolidation review status","level":1}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"# TanChat consolidation review status\n\nLocal implementation is available in this checkout. Release remains held for human review. The full consolidation goal is not complete.\n\n| Requirement                                          | Current evidence                                                                                                                        | Remaining verification                                                                                                                                   |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| TanStack-owned backend and identity                  | Shared PostgreSQL repositories, AuthService and SessionService; native authorization and revocation runtime tests                       | Real account login and session behavior through the UI                                                                                                   |\n| Complete harness at /chat                            | 603 files under src/chat; complete current local test gate                                                                              | Feature-by-feature rendered parity and ordinary real tasks                                                                                               |\n| Replace the Builder harness                          | Route redirects and retired private API boundaries; dedicated shared example and chart paths retained                                   | Real deep links, embeds and site navigation                                                                                                              |\n| Preserve motion and touch                            | Original handlers retained and wired; motion CSS emitted; gesture fixture checks                                                        | Reported animation regression and actual touch-device behavior                                                                                           |\n| Preserve streams, copies, retries and context        | 245 PostgreSQL/runtime tests; original copy benchmarks retained                                                                         | Live reconnect, long-history tails and copy latency                                                                                                      |\n| Shared site remains intact                           | Site tests; chat stylesheet scoping; actual startup and cleanup appearance checks                                                       | Real navigation into and out of chat                                                                                                                     |\n| Chat local execution bridge                          | Original broker bridge and ownership contract retained; source restricts bridge to DEV at http://127.0.0.1:3002 and broker at port 4320 | Provide a verified compatible broker/runtime and wire the actual TanStack execution path; localhost:3001 and production currently cannot use this bridge |\n| Models, integrations, files, workflows and schedules | Ported source and contract/runtime checks                                                                                               | Real configured model, MCP account, workflow, schedule and saved-file tasks                                                                              |\n| TanStack Cloudflare ownership                        | Local bindings and worker configuration; draft secret work recorded in consolidation history                                            | Deploy approved revision, verify resources and usage attribution                                                                                         |\n| chat.tanstack.com alias                              | Safe canonical redirect handler and navigation tests                                                                                    | DNS activation and real HTTP redirect verification                                                                                                       |\n| TanStack Electron                                    | Original native host, device/folder/update code and release scripts retained; 20 local tests                                            | Native account flow, notarized distributable and hosted updates if shipping                                                                              |\n| Reproducible installation                            | Current machine build passes                                                                                                            | Replace sibling-owned temporary browser-sandbox package references before clean CI installation                                                          |\n| Operational scripts                                  | Every original script listed in tanchat-script-port-inventory.json                                                                      | Resolve missing live diagnostics, smoke tests and research script dispositions                                                                           |\n| Release                                              | No release performed                                                                                                                    | Human review approval, deployment, deployed revision verification and cutover                                                                            |\n\nThe current combined local gate is /private/tmp/tanchat-consolidation-current-full-gate.log: five TypeScript checks pass, lint reports 106 warnings and zero errors, 508 site tests pass with two skipped, 2,208 harness tests pass in 224 files, and 20 Electron tests pass. The last separate PostgreSQL runtime result is /private/tmp/tanchat-runtime-all-original-files.log: 245 tests in 28 files.\n\nBrowser inspection of the local application was rejected by the browser tool's access policy. No alternate access path was used. Static source and fixture results do not close that verification gap.\n\nSee tanchat-consolidation.md for implementation history and evidence limits. Existing unrelated sibling work is preserved. No old account data is being migrated, and the old deployment is retained until replacement verification and approved cutover.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"# TanChat consolidation review status\n\nLocal implementation is available in this checkout. Release remains held for human review. The full consolidation goal is not complete.\n\n| Requirement                                          | Current evidence                                                                                                                        | Remaining verification                                                                                                                                   |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| TanStack-owned backend and identity                  | Shared PostgreSQL repositories, AuthService and SessionService; native authorization and revocation runtime tests                       | Real account login and session behavior through the UI                                                                                                   |\n| Complete harness at /chat                            | 603 files under src/chat; complete current local test gate                                                                              | Feature-by-feature rendered parity and ordinary real tasks                                                                                               |\n| Replace the Builder harness                          | Route redirects and retired private API boundaries; dedicated shared example and chart paths retained                                   | Real deep links, embeds and site navigation                                                                                                              |\n| Preserve motion and touch                            | Original handlers retained and wired; motion CSS emitted; gesture fixture checks                                                        | Reported animation regression and actual touch-device behavior                                                                                           |\n| Preserve streams, copies, retries and context        | 245 PostgreSQL/runtime tests; original copy benchmarks retained                                                                         | Live reconnect, long-history tails and copy latency                                                                                                      |\n| Shared site remains intact                           | Site tests; chat stylesheet scoping; actual startup and cleanup appearance checks                                                       | Real navigation into and out of chat                                                                                                                     |\n| Chat local execution bridge                          | Original broker bridge and ownership contract retained; source restricts bridge to DEV at http://127.0.0.1:3002 and broker at port 4320 | Provide a verified compatible broker/runtime and wire the actual TanStack execution path; localhost:3001 and production currently cannot use this bridge |\n| Models, integrations, files, workflows and schedules | Ported source and contract/runtime checks                                                                                               | Real configured model, MCP account, workflow, schedule and saved-file tasks                                                                              |\n| TanStack Cloudflare ownership                        | Local bindings and worker configuration; draft secret work recorded in consolidation history                                            | Deploy approved revision, verify resources and usage attribution                                                                                         |\n| chat.tanstack.com alias                              | Safe canonical redirect handler and navigation tests                                                                                    | DNS activation and real HTTP redirect verification                                                                                                       |\n| TanStack Electron                                    | Original native host, device/folder/update code and release scripts retained; 20 local tests                                            | Native account flow, notarized distributable and hosted updates if shipping                                                                              |\n| Reproducible installation                            | Current machine build passes                                                                                                            | Replace sibling-owned temporary browser-sandbox package references before clean CI installation                                                          |\n| Operational scripts                                  | Every original script listed in tanchat-script-port-inventory.json                                                                      | Resolve missing live diagnostics, smoke tests and research script dispositions                                                                           |\n| Release                                              | No release performed                                                                                                                    | Human review approval, deployment, deployed revision verification and cutover                                                                            |\n\nThe current combined local gate is /private/tmp/tanchat-consolidation-current-full-gate.log: five TypeScript checks pass, lint reports 106 warnings and zero errors, 508 site tests pass with two skipped, 2,208 harness tests pass in 224 files, and 20 Electron tests pass. The last separate PostgreSQL runtime result is /private/tmp/tanchat-runtime-all-original-files.log: 245 tests in 28 files.\n\nBrowser inspection of the local application was rejected by the browser tool's access policy. No alternate access path was used. Static source and fixture results do not close that verification gap.\n\nSee tanchat-consolidation.md for implementation history and evidence limits. Existing unrelated sibling work is preserved. No old account data is being migrated, and the old deployment is retained until replacement verification and approved cutover.\n"}
